{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a127b463891682ee053b964cfad63636be66ddde4d581711f1e077cd0a0bf0fe", "ja": "あったあった！　結婚情報誌『ハピマリ』！\n前に、劇場のみんなでお仕事したんだよね～♪", "zh": "找到了找到了！结婚资讯杂志《HAPPY MARI》！\n之前剧场的大家一起做过这份杂志的工作呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0944a76731e87cc0d024c1622676ae3fd41690dc5b2c92004db853a3d273275b", "ja": "ん？　でもこれ、日付け的に最新号みたい。\n昔の資料じゃないってことは……。", "zh": "嗯？不过看这个日期，好像是最新一期。\n既然不是以前的资料，那岂不是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "134a454a7b6942ebd3654f1118920a0be17ddc1e6de470176ac73236f05a7c43", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nあの、忘れ物をしてしまって……あ、それです！", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n那个，我落了东西……啊，就是那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "17637cfcc1b0066d56e9641fefb4ad17de62ea9e579c6c9b1c3d8b24f13935e2", "ja": "お疲れさまです。この『ハピマリ』最新号、\n{$P$}さんのだったんですね！", "zh": "辛苦了。这本《快乐婚礼》最新一期，原来是{$P$}先生的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "8399cbba6ffeaf7117a2025f64bff5858a1ecdc5344a02f754a4bd056ee61305", "ja": "ということは……{$P$}さん、\n結婚するんですか！？", "zh": "这么说来……{$P$}先生，您要结婚了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aee014e713b1243314654108cce8131c320d03298806f66cb5d602b8887ac50c", "ja": "へ？　いやいやまさか！\nこれは次の仕事で必要な資料なんですよ。", "zh": "诶？不不不，怎么可能！这是下次工作需要的资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "24192e36b1789ca6f4869a1ed6c028147192062964fbfd4c34a5b59281702daa", "ja": "あ、そうだったんですね……。\nよかった、安心しました。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样啊……  \n太好了，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "25dfc1381fcd94f2735a472245f7b4aeee8cf1f0500591b9ccfcc965deed17ab", "ja": "安心？", "zh": "放心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "21a889ec72c3ebd1ba74639fd4e0db0af5b3d0667202925b4cc56f808dcf3361", "ja": "あっ、ええと……最近、出費が多かったので！\nさらに結婚式となった場合、厳しいな～、なんて……。", "zh": "啊，那个……最近花销比较多嘛！\n要是再加上婚礼的话，就有点吃不消了呢～之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8d3a146b1e9eea0088474da20f32eda475d66212854d8e42eba61e9f853512d5", "ja": "はは、きつい時になぜか重なったりしますからね。\nでも本当に仕事の資料なので。", "zh": "哈哈，手头紧的时候，事情偏偏会撞在一起呢。不过，这真的只是工作资料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e7de46300adb7175d1cc3cb11bb461a395628b5b6e8bb8c02d445cf0021ec918", "ja": "資料も見つかったし、事務所へ行ってきます。\n劇場の留守、お願いしますね！", "zh": "资料也找到了，我去趟事务所。\n剧场就拜托你留守了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "e102e67590dcfade265ab689de4d313f5b510e2b883173c5073682679f568e40", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃーい！\n……次のお仕事、結婚式関係なのかな？", "zh": "好的，路上小心——！\n……下一个工作，是和婚礼有关的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "3a4ce10b4509737e35c5178b6ba1fbb5848b2dee0d4759171a7df2fe71f46813", "ja": "今のうちにウェディングドレスの資料を、\nたくさん集めておこうっと♪", "zh": "趁现在先多收集一些婚纱的资料吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "4d13fd7a4e52201fa82aa8a7b9375fb9bef51002e99ef44340120c11e3e05aef", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれたね！　資料から内容は\n察しているかと思うが、打ち合わせといこう。", "zh": "你好，欢迎你来！我想你应该已经从资料中猜到内容了，那我们就来开个会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "9bc56f2ef477c74ec38d76e53ddeaa9a2079c9e9f4766bb85bc32925fdb349fa", "ja": "結婚情報誌『ハピマリ』を765プロのアイドル達が\n飾った企画が大成功を収めたことは、記憶に新しい……", "zh": "由765位专业偶像为结婚资讯杂志《幸福婚礼》增色的企划大获成功，这件事还历历在目……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "acbc75445cc57c7b51ed4850209adb569bc59d77026021465768f610df82f805", "ja": "今回は、結婚式場からのオファーだ。\n十代のアイドルを中心としたブライダル企画だ！", "zh": "这次是婚礼会场发来的邀请。\n这是一个以十几岁的偶像为主的婚礼企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "918ae7250eb80eec32c02e0b91b25c9e6ccb6502de861dcc161db2240ec4faf7", "ja": "都内でも、指折りの有名な式場ですよね。\nでも、どうして十代のアイドル中心なんでしょう？", "zh": "在东京都内也是数一数二的知名会场吧。不过，为什么要以十几岁的偶像为主呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "332227688c786a2f0430c812b657339f85d16887a28b2bc000e2438d920cccd0", "ja": "うむ。先方としては、若い世代にも、結婚式に\n興味を持ってほしいという狙いのようだ。", "zh": "嗯。对方的用意，似乎是希望让年轻一代\n也对婚礼产生兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0286104c4507db7bcd9ae467301b3972e737b1aca372aabda38fbca5a5b1f347", "ja": "なるほど、それで十代のアイドル……。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才会找十几岁的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "d00d3c7d02c7779fdee1befe09a9ea1e3de4ad350ca26e75498f224572dc7c99", "ja": "将来の顧客を見込んだ戦略、ということですね！\nイメージは、明るくて爽やかな雰囲気かしら……。", "zh": "这是着眼于未来客户的策略呢！\n形象大概是明朗又清爽的氛围吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "dca5fa25e279df3e3167e320a1a4aa7caaec7a312ecc69b93161121613b7365a", "ja": "ブライダル業界から期待のオファーだ。\n君に一任したいところだが、どうかね？", "zh": "这是婚礼行业发来的期待邀约。虽然想全权交给你，你意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_1023", "source_sha256": "36c22d7e197012a55e8ff5bb4af1beef70b99abc089af9169ee00a17a4b0026a", "ja": "やります！", "zh": "我要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "96db235530f593a371f7b7c8537486300af40e8ef97ad28f66bbf93da2f9de0e", "ja": "当然やります！　うちのアイドル達が期待されて\nいるなら、それ以上の結果で応えなくては！", "zh": "当然要做！既然我们家的偶像们受到了期待，\n就必须用超出期待的成果来回应才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "e03a79cc804488bc6fa02896bc51a255226b38cd7e52e0c04c262f4267825fb9", "ja": "そう言ってくれると思っていたよ！\nでは、資料の詳細な説明に入ろうか。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说！  \n那么，我们开始详细说明资料吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c7c7ad462c241e3521353993778d1fe7e754bb33271871836c27b1e773e50378", "ja": "（以前とは切り口の違うブライダル企画……\nこれは、挑戦しがいがあるな！）", "zh": "（这是一个与以往切入角度不同的婚礼企划……看来很值得挑战啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
